Copy only the content inside the fence to `docs/README.md`, then adapt it. The links inside the
template are relative to that destination file, so they intentionally do not resolve from this
skill reference. Keep only links whose targets exist in the target repository.

````markdown
---
title: "Documentation"
doc_type: guide
---

# Documentation

Use this page to find current system behavior, interfaces, operations, and accepted decisions.
Keep it as navigation; put each contract on its owning page. Remove links for pages the repository
does not maintain.

